# The CI runner checks out on Linux/macOS, where a CRLF shell script fails with
# `$'\r': command not found`. Pin the text files that must be byte-exact in the
# runner's working tree. (Windows keeps its own CRLF working copy; git converts
# on commit, and these rules force LF in the repository itself.)
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.swift text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
